{
  "id": "qualitative-variable",
  "term": "qualitative variable",
  "definition": "A qualitative variable is a categorical variable whose values are labels or names rather than amounts, and its categories do not have a natural order. Even if its categories are given numbers for coding, those numbers do not carry numerical meaning.",
